den. <hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 16. 27 <hi rendition="#i">de pactis dot.</hi><lb/>
(23. 4.), <hi rendition="#i">L.</hi> 1 § 1 <hi rendition="#i">de dote prae-<lb/>
leg.</hi></hi> (33. 4.).</note><lb/>
