<p>               <note place="foot" n="(h)" xml:id="seg2pn_47_2" prev="#seg2pn_47_1"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">rat.</hi>&#x201D;</hi> In die&#x017F;en beiden Fällen<lb/>
