<note place="foot" n="(i)" xml:id="seg2pn_89_2" prev="#seg2pn_89_1"><hi rendition="#aq">ne il grande col confronto delle<lb/>
leggi Romane</hi> (3 Bände <hi rendition="#aq">Milano</hi><lb/>
