<p><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#k">Gellius</hi> IX. 4. &#x201E;Item esse compertum et creditum,<lb/>
Sauromatas &#x2026; cibum capere semper <hi rendition="#i">diebus tertiis, medio<lb/>
